WEBVTT

01:31.000 --> 01:35.920
Whether it's day or night,

01:36.000 --> 01:37.360
this troublemaker

01:37.440 --> 01:39.600
is forbidden

01:39.680 --> 01:41.320
from washing silk in Huanhua Creek!

01:42.640 --> 01:43.920
Mr. Hua,

01:44.440 --> 01:45.800
everyone knows

01:45.880 --> 01:48.800
that only the Shu brocade
washed in this creek

01:48.880 --> 01:50.440
can achieve its vibrant color.

01:50.520 --> 01:52.400
That's the only way
to create true Shu brocade.

01:52.480 --> 01:54.800
Huanhua Creek
is the backbone of every dyehouse!

01:54.880 --> 01:58.400
I don't know how I offended you
and why you ruin my business like this.

01:59.360 --> 02:00.560
You didn't offend me.

02:00.640 --> 02:03.400
You offended Mr. Sang!

02:04.000 --> 02:06.640
If you're allowed to wash silk here again,

02:06.720 --> 02:09.360
Mr. Sang will think that we're allies.

02:09.440 --> 02:13.120
Who's to say he won't come
and pick a fight with us one day?

02:13.200 --> 02:14.400
I'd like to ask

02:14.480 --> 02:17.760
who will dare
stand against Mr. Sang's wrath.

02:17.840 --> 02:21.560
Huanhua Creek has been open to all
for centuries.

02:21.640 --> 02:22.600
It bears no claim to your family's name!

02:23.640 --> 02:25.360
I never claim it is.

02:25.440 --> 02:27.560
I'm simply looking out
for everyone's interests.

02:27.640 --> 02:31.360
If it means we must play the villain,
so be it!

02:32.640 --> 02:33.680
Mr. Chen, what are you doing?

02:37.240 --> 02:38.720
I've purchased her silk by now.

02:38.800 --> 02:41.360
Have you the authority to stop me
from washing my own silk?

02:41.440 --> 02:43.640
- I'll buy some too.
- Give me the rest.

02:43.720 --> 02:45.120
Stop! Stop here!

02:45.200 --> 02:47.000
Do you take me for a fool?

02:47.520 --> 02:49.600
I've told you the Ji family is forbidden
from washing silk here!

02:49.680 --> 02:51.800
They are not permitted!

02:51.880 --> 02:53.800
And if any of you dare to aid her,
you can all leave now!

02:58.640 --> 03:01.920
- I kick you!
- Enough…

03:02.440 --> 03:05.440
This must be Hua Xiangrong's scheme
to keep you from washing silk.

03:05.520 --> 03:09.360
If Mrs. Hua knows about it,
she won't stop you.

03:09.440 --> 03:11.160
I'm the one she seeks to isolate.

03:11.240 --> 03:14.960
Stupid fool!
They're all scheming, every one of them!

03:15.040 --> 03:16.840
That woman is not a good person too!

03:16.920 --> 03:19.800
She's trying to use this
to drive our prices down!

03:19.880 --> 03:22.160
Mark my words, if she doesn't,
I'll write my name backward!

03:22.240 --> 03:24.200
Mr. Chen,
this will help settle your nerves.

03:24.280 --> 03:26.000
- Would you like some?
- I don't want it!

03:27.680 --> 03:30.120
Mr. Sheng,
is your box filled with medicine?

03:30.720 --> 03:31.600
Yes.

03:32.400 --> 03:34.120
I may appear quite strong…

03:39.840 --> 03:41.480
I mean,

03:41.560 --> 03:43.280
I've always been somewhat frail
since I was a child.

03:43.360 --> 03:44.440
My mother insists

03:44.520 --> 03:47.080
that I have enough medicine on hand
in case I need it.

03:47.760 --> 03:49.960
This is good for the heart.

03:50.040 --> 03:52.320
This one strengthens
the liver and stomach.

03:52.920 --> 03:54.880
And this one helps with sleep
and prenatal nourishment.

03:54.960 --> 03:56.080
Prenatal nourishment?

03:57.000 --> 03:59.680
Your mother certainly has
very high expectations of you!

04:00.480 --> 04:02.280
Medicine is for all, regardless of gender!

04:02.360 --> 04:04.680
It's all useful. You should take some.

04:04.760 --> 04:06.440
Why do I need prenatal nourishment?

04:06.520 --> 04:07.480
Have some, Mr. Chen.

04:08.080 --> 04:09.440
I don't need that!

04:09.520 --> 04:11.120
I want to eat his brain!

04:11.200 --> 04:12.960
I want to chew him up,

04:13.040 --> 04:15.680
lick his bones clean, and fry him to eat!

04:16.680 --> 04:18.240
This event happened because of me.

04:18.320 --> 04:19.839
I've dragged you
into this mess alongside me.

04:20.800 --> 04:22.560
What are you talking about?

04:23.240 --> 04:26.480
You've always helped us
delay Hua Xiangrong.

04:26.560 --> 04:28.240
We're not heartless!

04:28.320 --> 04:29.520
Even if this were to happen again,

04:29.600 --> 04:31.000
we could never stand by
and watch you being bullied.

04:31.080 --> 04:32.480
- Yes!
- That's right!

04:35.760 --> 04:37.800
You're all so spirited.

04:38.560 --> 04:39.440
Do you care to make a wager with me?

04:41.680 --> 04:43.120
W-What kind of wager?

04:43.840 --> 04:46.720
Do you know why the Hua family
dares to treat us this way?

04:47.720 --> 04:50.520
Because we're just small dyehouses,
with little power to speak of.

04:50.600 --> 04:52.600
The Hua family
is the largest dyehouse in the city.

04:52.680 --> 04:55.160
They get the whole cake, while
we're left to scramble for the crumbs.

04:55.240 --> 04:57.520
We have no choice
but to rely on the little scraps

04:57.600 --> 05:00.400
they toss our way to survive!

05:00.480 --> 05:03.480
Then, why would they bother
splitting their orders with us?

05:03.560 --> 05:05.600
Because our prices are low!

05:05.680 --> 05:08.600
It's far more profitable for them than
hiring more workers at their own dyehouse.

05:08.680 --> 05:11.440
Besides, they've long been accustomed
to driving our prices down.

05:11.520 --> 05:12.760
Not just that!

05:12.840 --> 05:14.000
Think about it.

05:14.080 --> 05:17.360
Their indigo silk
is mainly dyed by Ms. Zhu.

05:17.440 --> 05:20.240
They tend to order
green and blue silk from me.

05:20.320 --> 05:21.680
Their orders from your family

05:21.760 --> 05:23.920
are mostly for Shiyang brocade
and midnight purple.

05:24.000 --> 05:25.200
Yours is scarlet.

05:25.280 --> 05:26.920
Yours is olive and blue.

05:27.000 --> 05:30.920
Our dyehouses may be small,
but we have our own specialties!

05:31.000 --> 05:33.360
A lot of our colors are actually
done better than the Hua's Dyehouse!

05:34.480 --> 05:35.720
But…

05:35.800 --> 05:37.720
Our silk are all sold
through the Hua family.

05:37.800 --> 05:39.800
People only know Hua's Dyehouse.

05:39.880 --> 05:42.040
They don't know
about us smaller dyehouses.

05:43.680 --> 05:44.960
So?

05:45.920 --> 05:50.840
So, if we all join forces,
we'll become one large dyehouse,

05:51.520 --> 05:54.960
with the resources to handle
bigger orders.

05:55.600 --> 05:57.520
Once we've built our reputation,

05:57.600 --> 05:59.880
we won't have to fear a lack of business.

06:00.480 --> 06:02.280
We'll have the leverage
to secure better orders,

06:02.360 --> 06:05.360
and then, we won't have to worry
about being unable to wash our silk!

06:05.440 --> 06:07.760
Hold on. You make it sound so easy.

06:08.800 --> 06:11.360
It's not easy to build up a reputation.

06:11.440 --> 06:12.600
- I agree.
- I agree.

06:12.680 --> 06:15.480
All the larger dyehouses
have powerful individuals backing them.

06:15.560 --> 06:16.400
That's right!

06:16.480 --> 06:18.600
Just tell me.
Since we have no power or status,

06:18.680 --> 06:19.920
how can we fight against them?

06:20.000 --> 06:20.960
Yeah.

06:21.040 --> 06:23.640
Even if we compete against them,
they'd defeat us!

06:23.720 --> 06:25.320
That's right!

06:26.040 --> 06:27.800
When there's a will, there's a way.

06:27.880 --> 06:30.080
How could you know if you don't even try?

06:30.160 --> 06:31.080
- I…
- A kite!

06:35.520 --> 06:38.840
Which fool has the mind
to fly a kite at a time like this?

06:44.640 --> 06:46.560
Everyone, take some time to think it over.

06:46.640 --> 06:48.720
We'll discuss it again
once you've made up your minds.

06:48.800 --> 06:51.200
Mr. Chen,
please keep an eye on my silk for me.

06:51.280 --> 06:52.200
I…

06:52.280 --> 06:54.040
I'm going to see
what fool is out there flying a kite.

06:58.520 --> 07:00.120
What's so interesting about a fool?

07:00.200 --> 07:02.240
Why does she enjoy
surrounding herself with such idiots?

07:02.320 --> 07:03.360
That's right.

07:04.120 --> 07:05.400
You're the idiot!

07:19.120 --> 07:20.040
ZHAO XIUYUAN

07:20.120 --> 07:21.360
Xiuyuan!

07:23.760 --> 07:25.760
Why are you free to be out today?

07:26.400 --> 07:27.560
How is your brocade coming along?

07:32.000 --> 07:34.840
Don't think you can change the subject
just because you've given me some sweets.

07:36.680 --> 07:38.680
I heard about your incident
with Sang Shisi.

07:39.680 --> 07:41.080
I brought some medicine for you.

07:41.160 --> 07:43.920
But as I'm looking at you,
you don't seem hurt at all.

07:44.000 --> 07:45.000
I knew it!

07:45.520 --> 07:46.920
Whenever you get into a scuffle,

07:47.000 --> 07:48.520
it's always the other party
that ends up injured.

07:48.600 --> 07:50.480
I never said I'm not hurt.

07:52.080 --> 07:55.200
I'm injured right inside!
You'll need to get closer to see it.

07:55.280 --> 07:56.320
Where?

08:05.560 --> 08:07.280
I knew you were lying!

08:07.360 --> 08:08.800
I can smell the dye on you.

08:10.240 --> 08:13.120
Aren't you afraid of red?
Why would you put it on your face?

08:13.200 --> 08:15.160
I'm only afraid of red when it's flowing,

08:15.240 --> 08:17.360
when it runs like blood.

08:17.440 --> 08:18.720
Not all reds scare me.

08:20.440 --> 08:22.400
Alright, let's get back to business.

08:27.360 --> 08:30.120
I've looked into Sang Shisi.

08:30.920 --> 08:34.000
His sister is one
of the emperor's concubines.

08:34.080 --> 08:36.520
His father is a brocade officer.

08:36.600 --> 08:38.520
The other children
all have accomplished careers.

08:38.600 --> 08:41.559
He's the only one
who's done nothing but fool around.

08:43.840 --> 08:45.520
What are his hobbies?

08:46.400 --> 08:50.640
He is good at nothing,
but he excels at one thing.

08:50.720 --> 08:52.080
What?

08:52.160 --> 08:53.160
Madiao.

08:54.160 --> 08:55.640
Madiao?

08:57.160 --> 08:59.480
YUEBUHUAN

09:00.080 --> 09:01.600
How dare you serve me raw food?

09:01.680 --> 09:03.000
Innkeeper!

09:03.080 --> 09:04.560
If you still don't show yourself now,

09:04.640 --> 09:06.240
- I'm going to…!
- Going to what?

09:06.920 --> 09:09.040
Two guests, please head upstairs.

09:13.320 --> 09:14.280
You're the innkeeper?

09:14.880 --> 09:16.240
MS. YU, YUEBUHUAN INN

09:16.320 --> 09:17.560
Yu Linglong!

09:25.160 --> 09:26.720
What are you doing?

09:29.760 --> 09:31.160
I'm getting you a properly cooked dish.

09:31.840 --> 09:33.760
You must give me
a satisfactory answer today.

09:33.840 --> 09:36.600
At the very least,
you should compensate me.

09:38.000 --> 09:41.520
Well… It's fine if you refuse,

09:42.120 --> 09:45.760
but you should at least
have a drink with me, shouldn't you?

09:48.080 --> 09:49.320
Sure.

09:59.600 --> 10:02.120
Do you know why my inn
is called Yuebuhuan?

10:02.200 --> 10:03.760
How could I know?

10:03.840 --> 10:05.120
We offer fine wine here.

10:05.200 --> 10:07.800
Guests who stay the night

10:08.400 --> 10:09.720
won't be allowed credit.

10:09.800 --> 10:11.960
If it's not paid within the month,
they won't be allowed to go home.

10:13.440 --> 10:15.640
Eat if you like it. If not, just leave!

10:17.360 --> 10:18.560
You run a shady establishment!

10:18.640 --> 10:20.640
You serve us moldy food!

10:20.720 --> 10:22.320
Don't you realize that could kill us?

10:22.400 --> 10:24.680
I'm going to report you!

10:24.760 --> 10:27.720
When Mr. Wang was still
Xichuan's military commissioner,

10:27.800 --> 10:29.400
he once dined here

10:29.480 --> 10:31.880
and praised the fish.

10:31.960 --> 10:33.920
He said it was like shimmering gold
among falling petals,

10:34.000 --> 10:35.960
a taste so exquisite it surpassed
even the beauty of Jiangnan's landscapes.

10:36.560 --> 10:39.920
Mr. Wang gave such high praises,
yet you dismiss it,

10:40.000 --> 10:42.120
calling it unfit for human consumption.

10:42.200 --> 10:43.600
You've insulted Mr. Wang terribly.

10:43.680 --> 10:47.280
I wonder who will be held accountable
when this reaches the court.

10:49.640 --> 10:50.680
Why should I listen to you?

10:51.280 --> 10:52.400
If I were you,

10:53.800 --> 10:56.360
I'd settle the bill quickly,
then hurry home and hide.

10:56.440 --> 10:58.600
I'll only mention this
once everyone has forgotten about it.

11:02.280 --> 11:03.800
I'll never come here again!

11:03.880 --> 11:05.760
Never again!

11:08.640 --> 11:09.960
Apologies for the interruption.

11:10.560 --> 11:14.120
I'll offer a discount
on all alcoholic beverages today!

11:14.200 --> 11:15.760
Thank you, Ms. Yu!

11:15.840 --> 11:17.240
- Waiter!
- Come here please!

11:17.320 --> 11:19.280
- Get us another bottle!
- I'm coming!

11:19.360 --> 11:23.440
When did Mr. Wang
ever praise my fish here?

11:23.520 --> 11:24.520
I made it up.

11:24.600 --> 11:26.480
They won't be meeting Mr. Wang anyway.

11:26.560 --> 11:29.440
And even if they do,
all they will talk about is work.

11:29.520 --> 11:30.920
Who would bother
with something so trivial?

11:31.720 --> 11:33.160
What brings you here?

11:33.240 --> 11:35.360
Have you heard about my incident
with Sang Shisi?

11:36.480 --> 11:37.960
Your name has traveled far.

11:38.040 --> 11:40.320
Ms. Ji would not bow to power

11:40.400 --> 11:42.560
and bravely stood up against Mr. Sang!

11:43.560 --> 11:45.240
Do you want to make a name
for yourself too?

11:48.280 --> 11:51.120
Borrow me your place for two days,
and then borrow me some money.

11:51.200 --> 11:52.200
Lend you some money?

11:53.560 --> 11:55.720
Look how empty this place is!

11:55.800 --> 11:57.360
It just has several customers
for a whole day.

11:57.440 --> 11:58.600
I have no money to lend you.

11:58.680 --> 12:00.880
Just lend me the money.

12:00.960 --> 12:03.280
I guarantee your inn
will be filled with customers,

12:03.360 --> 12:04.920
and you'll be making a fortune every day.

12:06.960 --> 12:09.000
Do you have a plan
to deal with the Hua family?

12:09.080 --> 12:10.480
Or is this all for Sang Shisi?

12:15.640 --> 12:18.200
Everyone knows that the way
to fight power is with power.

12:27.600 --> 12:28.640
Good!

12:33.960 --> 12:35.000
Well done!

12:42.200 --> 12:43.960
Thank you for letting me win.

12:44.640 --> 12:48.000
The Queen of Gambling is highly skilled.
You make us feel inadequate.

12:49.080 --> 12:50.520
You're far too kind.

12:51.560 --> 12:52.720
Anyone else wants to play?

12:55.640 --> 12:56.960
It's you?

12:57.640 --> 12:58.800
You're the Queen of Gambling?

12:58.880 --> 13:00.600
Come on. Play a round with me.

13:07.000 --> 13:08.800
I'm talking to you! Didn't you hear me?

13:11.040 --> 13:13.200
Do you know why I am gambling with money?

13:14.480 --> 13:15.320
Why?

13:15.400 --> 13:17.840
Because I offended Mr. Sang
at Huanhua Creek.

13:17.920 --> 13:19.760
The Hua family fears
I'll bring trouble to them,

13:19.840 --> 13:21.480
so they won't let me work at the creek.

13:21.560 --> 13:23.560
My dyehouse is on the brink
of closing down!

13:23.640 --> 13:26.120
I have no choice
but to rely on this to support my family.

13:26.720 --> 13:28.160
How could I know such matters?

13:28.920 --> 13:31.320
Never mind.
Once I have spoken my mind, I move on.

13:31.920 --> 13:34.880
I never imagined the Hua family
would ensnare you using my name.

13:34.960 --> 13:36.760
We shall discuss this later.
But now, let us make a wager!

13:36.840 --> 13:38.360
- No.
- You…!

13:42.000 --> 13:43.200
Very well. I shall accept your wager.

13:43.280 --> 13:44.640
Regardless of the outcome,

13:44.720 --> 13:47.040
I will see to it that the Hua family
leaves you in peace!

13:47.800 --> 13:50.160
- Really?
- I stand by word.

13:51.440 --> 13:52.360
Come on!

14:01.160 --> 14:03.120
Place your wager on big or small.

14:03.200 --> 14:04.680
Twenty wen each round

14:04.760 --> 14:07.160
until you have claimed
all of your opponent's money.

14:08.560 --> 14:09.680
Anything you like.

14:16.880 --> 14:17.760
Seventy thousand guan.

14:20.400 --> 14:21.680
Eighty thousand guan.

14:21.760 --> 14:23.120
Impressive!

14:28.840 --> 14:30.400
70,000 GUAN, 7 SUOZI, 80,000 GUAN, 8 SUOZI

14:34.880 --> 14:35.800
50,000 GUAN, 60,000 GUAN.

14:46.800 --> 14:48.640
Ms. Ji's skills are truly remarkable.

14:49.160 --> 14:50.880
She won eight times out of ten.

14:50.960 --> 14:52.520
She is indeed impressive.

14:52.600 --> 14:55.120
She wins when she wants.
She loses when she wants.

14:55.200 --> 14:56.440
What does that mean?

14:58.400 --> 14:59.720
What do I mean?

15:00.680 --> 15:03.760
You should eat something before drinking,
or you'll harm your health.

15:07.200 --> 15:10.720
You fare well
even without the aid of your family.

15:14.360 --> 15:15.880
I never expected

15:15.960 --> 15:18.760
that you'd be the first to recognize me
with me not returning all these years.

15:23.480 --> 15:26.360
Three meals a day,
and the journey stretches before me.

15:26.880 --> 15:28.280
With a carefree heart,

15:28.360 --> 15:29.800
the days pass in ease.

15:31.200 --> 15:33.280
Come on, my sister.

15:35.720 --> 15:37.240
Thank you for thinking about me.

15:48.760 --> 15:51.360
Your wine is as exquisite as ever.

15:52.400 --> 15:54.280
You're making me sound old
by calling me sister.

15:55.720 --> 15:56.720
Alright.

16:03.120 --> 16:04.120
What rotten luck.

16:04.640 --> 16:05.640
Let's take a break.

16:13.800 --> 16:17.040
Mr. Sang, I have already conceded.
Please, allow me to return home.

16:17.120 --> 16:19.240
No yet! I am far from finished!

16:19.320 --> 16:20.720
Come on. Let us play 300 more rounds!

16:21.440 --> 16:22.840
Little rascal!

16:24.280 --> 16:25.440
You little rascal!

16:25.520 --> 16:26.480
I just came…!

16:26.560 --> 16:29.360
I just came back,
and you're already causing me trouble!

16:29.440 --> 16:30.880
You…!

16:30.960 --> 16:32.760
You are… still running!

16:32.840 --> 16:35.240
You even forced a poor girl
to gamble with you.

16:35.320 --> 16:36.680
Stand right there!

16:37.920 --> 16:39.440
Stop hitting him…!

16:41.040 --> 16:43.440
- Get down here!
- No! You'll hit me if I do!

16:49.040 --> 16:51.440
- Stand there!
- Chief Sang,

16:51.520 --> 16:52.840
you've misunderstood.

16:52.920 --> 16:55.680
Mr. Sang and I are not here to gamble.

16:55.760 --> 16:57.920
We were attracting a crowd for business.

16:58.520 --> 17:00.120
- Yes…
- What business?

17:00.880 --> 17:02.960
What business?
Tell my father about it now.

17:04.400 --> 17:06.280
I had no intention of revealing it.

17:06.359 --> 17:09.680
But since you have asked, I will show you.
Mr. Jiang, take it out.

17:14.839 --> 17:18.440
Here. This is a Madiao pouch
crafted by the Silk Society.

17:18.520 --> 17:20.480
A Madiao pouch?

17:20.560 --> 17:21.760
I have never heard of such a thing.

17:21.839 --> 17:24.440
These were blessed by Leizu herself.

17:24.520 --> 17:26.200
Each carries its own meaning.

17:26.280 --> 17:27.599
Look.

17:27.680 --> 17:28.880
Wanguan.

17:28.960 --> 17:33.080
It symbolizes families and merchants
prospering with each passing day.

17:34.600 --> 17:35.840
This is suozi.

17:35.920 --> 17:40.200
It carries a blessing for scholars
to succeed in their exams.

17:41.320 --> 17:42.760
And this is wenqian.

17:42.840 --> 17:46.600
It symbolizes the flow of thoughts
and a bright future to come.

17:46.680 --> 17:48.200
That's good.

17:48.280 --> 17:50.080
Oh, this is a great one. Shiwan.

17:50.160 --> 17:51.000
SIWAN

17:51.080 --> 17:54.000
This is a gift that Mr. Sang
specially wished to present to you.

17:54.920 --> 17:56.080
For me?

17:58.400 --> 17:59.440
Yes, Father.

17:59.520 --> 18:01.640
Father, this is for you.

18:01.720 --> 18:02.760
I will help you put it on.

18:08.160 --> 18:11.520
This is a blessing, wishing you
a life free of mistakes,

18:11.600 --> 18:13.800
with good health and longevity.

18:13.880 --> 18:16.360
It is Mr. Sang's affection for you.

18:18.840 --> 18:20.840
This little thing is quite intriguing.

18:21.640 --> 18:24.280
Miss,
when do you plan to begin selling it?

18:24.360 --> 18:25.800
If everyone likes them,

18:25.880 --> 18:29.800
the Silk Society shall do our utmost
to produce them, okay?

18:29.880 --> 18:32.600
Mr. Chen? Mr. Jiang? Mr. Sheng?

18:32.680 --> 18:33.960
- Yes.
- Yes.

18:34.040 --> 18:35.360
Exactly…

18:36.320 --> 18:37.520
Silk Society?

18:38.960 --> 18:40.520
During your absence,

18:40.600 --> 18:42.880
Mr. Sang took pity on our hardships

18:42.960 --> 18:44.960
and thus established the Silk Society
on our behalf.

18:45.040 --> 18:48.080
- The Madiao pouch marks our first venture.
- Yes…

18:48.160 --> 18:49.720
Mr. Sang serves as our honorary president.

18:50.320 --> 18:53.080
We are not truly gambling here.

18:53.160 --> 18:55.440
We merely sought to spread word
of our endeavor.

19:00.000 --> 19:02.680
Are you truly doing a business?

19:03.560 --> 19:06.480
Yes, Father. You have misunderstood me.

19:07.200 --> 19:10.040
Chief Sang,
you have misunderstood our president.

19:10.720 --> 19:13.080
He has worked tirelessly

19:13.160 --> 19:14.400
for us.

19:19.400 --> 19:20.880
Interesting.

19:23.360 --> 19:25.200
- Don't bully others.
- Okay.

19:25.720 --> 19:27.480
And don't get bullied too.

19:31.320 --> 19:32.760
- Goodbye, Father.
- Take care, Chief Sang.

19:32.840 --> 19:34.480
Take care, Chief Sang.

19:36.800 --> 19:37.760
Esteemed guests,

19:37.840 --> 19:40.960
if you fancy the Madiao pouch
crafted by the Silk Society,

19:41.040 --> 19:42.720
we invite you to place your orders now.

19:42.800 --> 19:44.080
The first 50 orders
will receive a special half-price offer.

19:44.160 --> 19:46.480
The design that Chief Sang possesses
is particularly intricate.

19:46.560 --> 19:49.360
We don't have that many of it.
Only 30 can be reserved.

19:49.440 --> 19:50.320
They shall be sold on a first-come,
first-served basis.

19:50.400 --> 19:51.880
- I want it…!
- Listen here.

19:51.960 --> 19:54.680
If you wish to have one,
place your orders with me.

20:01.560 --> 20:02.880
Are you using me?

20:03.720 --> 20:05.040
- Yes.
- Yes?

20:05.720 --> 20:08.680
We were only here to sell the pouches.
Who knew you would come?

20:08.760 --> 20:10.960
And I certainly did not expect
your father's arrival.

20:11.040 --> 20:13.880
In a few days, you may inform your father

20:13.960 --> 20:15.520
that you no longer wish to serve
as the honorary president.

20:15.600 --> 20:17.520
Then, there will be nothing
binding you to us.

20:17.600 --> 20:18.440
No way!

20:18.520 --> 20:21.080
It is already official now.
I cannot simply walk away from it.

20:21.840 --> 20:24.400
But being our honorary president means
you must lend a hand in our efforts.

20:25.760 --> 20:26.880
Do you think I am incapable of helping?

20:29.840 --> 20:31.120
Alright, you can try.

20:32.680 --> 20:35.440
As the honorary president,
will there be any benefits afforded to me?

20:35.520 --> 20:38.080
Oh, Mr. Yang.
Of course there is. I'll get it for you.

20:38.160 --> 20:39.720
- Come.
- How annoying.

20:44.000 --> 20:47.480
I wish to gamble with Ms. Ji.

20:47.560 --> 20:50.680
The loser shall be bound to honor a deal
with the winner.

20:50.760 --> 20:52.360
- No.
- Sure!

20:53.480 --> 20:55.840
Shisi, what kind of president are you?

20:55.920 --> 20:57.200
Honorary president.

20:58.520 --> 21:00.080
No wonder no one heeds your words.

21:00.720 --> 21:02.760
It is a title without power.

21:04.000 --> 21:06.920
Could she have been deceiving you
from the beginning?

21:07.000 --> 21:07.960
Think about it.

21:08.040 --> 21:10.400
Was it mere coincidence
that your father arrived?

21:10.480 --> 21:13.640
- Was it a coincidence they had to…?
- Come!

21:15.880 --> 21:16.880
I'll gamble with you.

21:20.240 --> 21:23.600
Ms. Ji, why don't we play it differently?

21:23.680 --> 21:25.960
Let us each play with three cards.

21:26.040 --> 21:27.840
- It will be quicker.
- Sure.

21:43.440 --> 21:45.080
1 SUOZI

21:45.160 --> 21:47.560
Ms. Ji, please.

21:51.760 --> 21:52.600
80,000 GUAN

21:54.920 --> 21:56.240
70,000 GUAN, 80,000 GUAN

21:58.280 --> 21:59.840
8 SUOZI

22:00.560 --> 22:01.720
That's huge.

22:04.880 --> 22:06.080
He is losing for sure.

22:06.160 --> 22:09.640
Mr. Yang's cards fall short beside hers.

22:12.320 --> 22:13.760
9 SUOZI

22:14.400 --> 22:15.760
- Wow!
- He's so good!

22:15.840 --> 22:17.040
90,000 GUAN, 9 SUOZI

22:18.880 --> 22:20.040
He's so good!

22:20.120 --> 22:22.400
This is the first time.

22:22.480 --> 22:23.840
90,000 GUAN, 9 SUOZI, 900,000 GUAN

22:23.920 --> 22:25.240
Excellent.

22:25.320 --> 22:26.520
Impressive!

22:26.600 --> 22:28.040
He's good.

22:30.200 --> 22:31.440
Excellent.

22:31.520 --> 22:32.800
Ms. Ji,

22:33.320 --> 22:35.680
is there something amiss with my cards?

22:38.440 --> 22:41.080
Mr. Yang, your prowess is unmatched.

22:41.160 --> 22:42.400
I admit defeat.

22:44.520 --> 22:45.680
Please, make your request.

22:45.760 --> 22:48.480
I wish to pay a visit to your home.

22:49.080 --> 22:51.000
Why is it that you always wish
to visit my home?

22:54.240 --> 22:57.880
It is thanks to all of you
that this has gone so smoothly.

22:57.960 --> 22:59.560
- Us?
- Us…?

23:00.440 --> 23:01.640
- Did you hear?
- No.

23:01.720 --> 23:03.960
- A new gambling champion in Yizhou!
- One person orders six pieces!

23:04.040 --> 23:06.000
She has never lost.

23:06.080 --> 23:08.280
She has defeated everyone in Yizhou.

23:08.360 --> 23:11.160
Anyone who gambles with her
will only bring shame upon themselves.

23:11.240 --> 23:12.160
Of course.

23:12.240 --> 23:14.280
Take me to her at once!

23:15.080 --> 23:16.200
Chief Sang,

23:16.720 --> 23:18.880
Mr. Sang is forcing others
to gamble with him.

23:18.960 --> 23:20.600
None are permitted to leave
until he is pleased.

23:20.680 --> 23:22.320
You must uphold justice.

23:24.920 --> 23:26.160
I will go take a look!

23:30.040 --> 23:31.280
We made the Madiao pouches.

23:31.360 --> 23:35.400
Wan Wan, a few others, and I
worked tireless for days to make them.

23:35.920 --> 23:38.800
We tricked Sang Shisi
into gambling with you,

23:38.880 --> 23:40.440
using his beloved Madiao card game.

23:40.520 --> 23:42.560
We then drew in his father
to teach him a lesson,

23:42.640 --> 23:45.800
and now he is bound by us,
made to take on the position of president.

23:45.880 --> 23:47.280
It's all connected.

23:47.360 --> 23:48.960
- Impressive.
- Brilliant.

23:49.040 --> 23:50.320
I have a question.

23:50.400 --> 23:52.200
Are you really the god of gambling?

23:58.160 --> 23:59.600
Eight suozi.

23:59.680 --> 24:00.680
8 SUOZI

24:02.360 --> 24:03.440
Fifty thousand guan.

24:04.400 --> 24:05.320
Seven wen.

24:06.280 --> 24:07.360
7 WEN

24:09.080 --> 24:10.160
All of these cards

24:10.240 --> 24:13.240
show slight differences in color

24:13.320 --> 24:15.440
after being worn by sweat, alcohol,
and tea stains.

24:15.520 --> 24:17.480
I remember them by their hues.

24:18.160 --> 24:19.440
Alright.

24:20.040 --> 24:21.600
What do we do next?

24:23.240 --> 24:26.800
We'll take revenge, of course.

24:33.280 --> 24:36.400
The expense of lamp oil alone
is far too high this month.

24:38.480 --> 24:39.720
This is bad.

24:56.160 --> 24:57.400
We should save more.

24:57.920 --> 24:59.680
Pay it sooner.

24:59.760 --> 25:01.160
Yingying won't have to work so much then.

25:01.240 --> 25:02.240
Yaoting,

25:03.160 --> 25:04.240
you scared me.

25:05.440 --> 25:07.120
Sneaking out again?

25:08.000 --> 25:09.400
You're really forming this chamber?

25:21.680 --> 25:25.360
Yaoting,
I have waited years for this moment.

25:26.560 --> 25:29.720
I started this trouble with Sang Shisi,

25:29.800 --> 25:32.080
but every crisis presents an opportunity.

25:33.360 --> 25:36.200
How could I not be aware
that I've offended Mrs. Hua

25:36.280 --> 25:37.600
and that she will seek revenge?

25:38.120 --> 25:41.040
Does that mean that she won't scheme
against us if we don't provoke her?

25:43.800 --> 25:46.720
The Hua family has powerful backing.

25:47.240 --> 25:49.160
I don't know who is backing them.

25:49.240 --> 25:51.360
I don't know about their schemes too.

25:51.440 --> 25:53.480
But doing business
is much like gambling with Madiao cards.

25:53.560 --> 25:56.000
If you cannot read your opponent's hand,

25:56.080 --> 25:58.400
the only choice
is to make yours the strongest.

25:59.520 --> 26:01.320
So, Yaoting,

26:05.040 --> 26:06.240
I'm begging you.

26:15.360 --> 26:16.800
Thanks, Yaoting.

26:21.360 --> 26:24.160
Stock up on more dye and silk thread
in the coming days.

26:24.240 --> 26:25.800
Take on orders
beyond those of the Hua family.

26:25.880 --> 26:28.920
Accept the orders,
even if they are less profitable.

26:29.600 --> 26:30.640
What are you up to now?

26:31.840 --> 26:33.240
Just a precaution.

26:33.760 --> 26:35.640
I've already told Mr. Chen and the others,

26:35.720 --> 26:39.720
but Pin's family does not wish for me
to have contact with her at this time.

26:39.800 --> 26:40.960
I beg you
to take care of this errand for me.

26:41.760 --> 26:43.320
Stocking up on dye is a good idea,

26:43.400 --> 26:45.280
but with Mrs. Hua
holding control over Huanhua Creek,

26:45.360 --> 26:46.680
we have no place to wash the silk.

26:46.760 --> 26:47.640
Yaoting, trust me.

26:47.720 --> 26:49.440
We will soon
have a place to wash our silk.

26:49.520 --> 26:50.720
Ji Yingying.

26:54.920 --> 26:56.080
Mother!

27:00.880 --> 27:01.720
That's outrageous!

27:01.800 --> 27:05.400
How dare they seize territory
and not let us wash our silks?

27:05.480 --> 27:06.640
That was before.

27:06.720 --> 27:09.480
But now that you are here,
let's see who dares to stand in our way.

27:10.040 --> 27:12.400
Don't worry.
As long as I'm here, I will protect you.

27:12.480 --> 27:14.440
Let's see if they have the courage to act.

27:14.520 --> 27:15.760
Of course…

27:18.600 --> 27:20.080
They are here…

27:20.160 --> 27:21.600
They are here.

27:21.680 --> 27:23.160
- Go.
- Go.

27:29.200 --> 27:30.320
Starting today,

27:30.400 --> 27:32.440
we will wash our silk here,

27:32.520 --> 27:34.520
be it day or night.

27:34.600 --> 27:37.480
Useless son, living off others!

27:37.560 --> 27:40.720
Go home and tend to your mother's feet!

27:40.800 --> 27:42.200
Go!

27:45.480 --> 27:46.560
You scoundrels!

27:47.840 --> 27:48.920
I'll fight you.

27:49.000 --> 27:51.440
My father always says
we should think more and act less.

27:51.520 --> 27:52.760
Always persuade others with reason.

27:52.840 --> 27:55.880
Today's goal is to reason
in a harmonious manner.

27:55.960 --> 27:57.840
Why are you just standing there? Get them!

27:57.920 --> 28:00.400
- Wait…
- Hey!

28:00.480 --> 28:01.840
Listen here.

28:03.280 --> 28:06.520
We are now under the protection
of Mr. Sang.

28:06.600 --> 28:08.160
Try us.

28:08.240 --> 28:11.920
Listen! At the creek, I am supreme!

28:12.000 --> 28:13.480
Mr. Sang means nothing here!

28:13.560 --> 28:14.960
Who is Mr. Sang?

28:15.040 --> 28:17.320
- Get them!
- How dare you insult Mr. Sang!

28:17.400 --> 28:19.480
- I just did! What will you do now?
- Mr. Sang,

28:19.560 --> 28:21.280
are we still going to reason
in a harmonious manner?

28:21.360 --> 28:22.280
How dare you!

28:22.360 --> 28:23.720
- Go!
- Let's go find him first.

28:23.800 --> 28:24.960
- Hurry… follow him.
- Go.

28:27.120 --> 28:28.600
Get in here!

28:29.680 --> 28:31.040
Go away!

28:38.480 --> 28:41.080
Mr. Sang…
I didn't know it was you, Mr. Sang.

28:42.800 --> 28:43.800
Hit him!

28:43.880 --> 28:45.200
Hit him…!

28:45.280 --> 28:46.280
Hit him…!

28:54.480 --> 28:56.560
- Hit him!
- Hit him…!

29:04.920 --> 29:06.640
Are you acknowledging defeat?

29:08.080 --> 29:09.480
Hua Xiangrong, you deserve it!

29:12.040 --> 29:14.920
It's them! They are fighting at the creek!

29:15.440 --> 29:17.120
Stop now!

29:20.280 --> 29:23.080
BROCADE BUREAU

29:24.920 --> 29:27.240
- Help me see if it's broken!
- It's bleeding…

29:27.320 --> 29:29.000
- It's bleeding?
- It's bleeding!

29:29.080 --> 29:30.920
Hua Xiangrong, how dare you!

29:31.000 --> 29:33.720
You have struck me until I am wounded!

29:33.800 --> 29:35.680
How dare you!

29:35.760 --> 29:37.600
Mr. Sang, I didn't know it was you!

29:37.680 --> 29:40.560
- If I had known, I wouldn't have dared!
- Not only did he strike you,

29:40.640 --> 29:42.320
- but he also insulted you!
- He insulted you!

29:42.400 --> 29:43.640
- Shut up!
- He insulted you.

29:43.720 --> 29:45.520
You shut up! I remember it now.

29:45.600 --> 29:47.000
You said I mean nothing.

29:47.080 --> 29:48.320
I'm telling you…

29:48.400 --> 29:49.360
He even went as far
as to call you a heap of dung!

29:49.440 --> 29:51.480
Did you call me that?

29:51.560 --> 29:53.520
- Do you have a death wish?
- Shut up!

29:54.600 --> 29:56.280
- Father?
- Shut up!

29:56.360 --> 29:58.080
- I've been injured!
- Kneel!

29:59.320 --> 30:00.440
I told you to kneel!

30:04.000 --> 30:05.920
Do you wish to humiliate me further?

30:10.240 --> 30:11.320
You,

30:14.280 --> 30:15.440
come with me.

30:18.120 --> 30:19.320
Yes, sir.

30:32.480 --> 30:34.040
You know as well as I do.

30:34.120 --> 30:35.920
Only silk washed in the waters
of Huanhua Creek

30:36.000 --> 30:39.720
can be woven into Shu brocade
with vibrant, long-lasting colors.

30:39.800 --> 30:41.120
That is what makes it true Shu brocade.

30:41.720 --> 30:42.680
For years,

30:42.760 --> 30:45.040
dyehouses have seized land
along the creek.

30:45.120 --> 30:47.360
These people suffer in silence,
while the officers turn a blind eye.

30:47.880 --> 30:50.800
Now that Mr. Sang has caused a scene
at the creek,

30:50.880 --> 30:54.000
I fear those with ulterior motives
will take advantage of this.

30:56.520 --> 30:59.000
Her Highness
is highly favored in the palace.

30:59.080 --> 31:01.840
If those who envy her
cannot act within the palace,

31:01.920 --> 31:03.760
they will surely strike from without.

31:04.520 --> 31:05.880
If His Majesty hears that

31:05.960 --> 31:07.920
her family has become
haughty, oppressive, and unruly

31:08.000 --> 31:10.160
due to her position,

31:10.240 --> 31:12.160
what do you suppose he will think of her?

31:15.120 --> 31:19.120
Those with ulterior motives?
Isn't she standing before me now?

31:22.240 --> 31:24.200
It's true I have my own motives,

31:24.960 --> 31:26.680
but they are honorable ones.

31:26.760 --> 31:29.880
Do you know
who lured Mr. Sang to the creek?

31:32.120 --> 31:33.680
So, you already know.

31:34.800 --> 31:35.760
What makes you any different?

31:36.840 --> 31:39.720
I can guide your son
to abandon his reckless ways

31:39.800 --> 31:42.440
and become a man of honor and integrity.

31:43.720 --> 31:44.680
You?

31:45.840 --> 31:47.240
How exactly would you manage that?

31:47.920 --> 31:51.960
I trust you have inquired
into the present state of the Ji family

31:52.040 --> 31:54.000
and taken measure
of the kind of person I am,

31:54.080 --> 31:55.720
following our last meeting.

31:58.760 --> 32:01.120
The notorious Ms. Spitfire
of Huanhua Creek.

32:01.200 --> 32:04.160
I'll admit,
you do possess a certain boldness.

32:04.240 --> 32:06.520
Speak. What do you want?

32:10.960 --> 32:14.160
This incident arose from disputes
over territory at Huanhua Creek.

32:14.240 --> 32:16.480
It's particularly sensitive
as it involves Shu brocade.

32:16.560 --> 32:20.200
But if the creek belongs to everyone
and private claims are forbidden,

32:20.280 --> 32:23.400
then your son was simply playing
by the creek

32:23.480 --> 32:24.880
and got into a fight.

32:26.400 --> 32:27.800
You are saying…

32:30.880 --> 32:33.040
I ask that you establish a new rule,

32:33.120 --> 32:35.240
clearly stating that
Huanhua Creek is to be shared by all

32:35.320 --> 32:36.360
and that no individual shall have
exclusive rights to wash silk there.

32:39.800 --> 32:43.040
Do you believe they will heed the rule
merely because I issue it?

32:43.120 --> 32:46.720
Which of the major dyehouses
claiming land along the creek

32:46.800 --> 32:48.240
does not have powerful support behind it?

32:48.840 --> 32:50.520
Your rule would reflect your position.

32:50.600 --> 32:53.400
Should they defy it, it would plainly
reveal their contempt for the law.

32:54.680 --> 32:55.840
If I establish this rule,

32:55.920 --> 32:58.440
it will imply
that you too have powerful backing.

32:58.520 --> 33:02.080
At the very least, they wouldn't dare
to drive you away again.

33:02.160 --> 33:03.000
Am I correct?

33:13.960 --> 33:15.400
I believe that

33:15.920 --> 33:17.080
if given the opportunity,

33:17.160 --> 33:20.840
you have the ability to restore
the Ji family to its former glory.

33:28.040 --> 33:29.640
This is something
I have embroidered myself.

33:30.160 --> 33:31.040
I am giving it to you.

33:31.120 --> 33:31.960
WEALTH

33:34.120 --> 33:37.280
What is the matter? Don't you want it?
Do you think it's ugly?

33:38.160 --> 33:39.560
Did I make it that obvious?

33:40.760 --> 33:41.600
Zhao Xiuyuan!

33:43.240 --> 33:44.720
- Give it to me.
- No!

33:45.760 --> 33:49.440
I just meant I'm afraid I won't be able
to become a wealthy person.

33:51.800 --> 33:54.160
Do you know why I'm giving this to you?

33:56.080 --> 33:57.680
It's because you don't lack wisdom.

33:57.760 --> 33:59.120
You are already brimming
with creative ideas

33:59.200 --> 34:00.040
and destined for greatness.

34:00.720 --> 34:02.920
You lack neither resources
nor short of financial stability.

34:03.000 --> 34:05.240
It is because
you have always sought both high and low,

34:06.240 --> 34:07.640
leaving no room for oversight.

34:09.719 --> 34:11.520
Since I am without means,
allow me to offer you a painting instead.

34:24.520 --> 34:27.440
Though there's no roc in the painting,

34:27.520 --> 34:30.560
the rolling clouds
capture its majestic ascent.

34:30.639 --> 34:32.600
A lone woman stands at the bow of a ship,

34:32.679 --> 34:35.120
radiating grace with effortless charm.

34:36.040 --> 34:38.040
Who says women
cannot sail against the tide?

34:38.120 --> 34:40.080
Who says they cannot shine with ambition?

34:44.199 --> 34:47.639
But why does this woman's silhouette
seem so familiar?

34:48.639 --> 34:50.400
Soaring to the heavens.

34:50.920 --> 34:53.239
Is that not how I perceive you?

34:55.719 --> 34:58.280
So, even you know how to flatter people.

35:05.840 --> 35:07.600
Let's turn this painting into brocade.

35:11.360 --> 35:13.840
The clouds, water, the ship,

35:14.560 --> 35:15.800
and even the woman.

35:17.040 --> 35:19.240
If done properly,
it should not be too difficult to weave.

35:19.760 --> 35:20.720
Yet,

35:21.240 --> 35:23.800
capturing the vast essence of the painting
is no easy task.

35:26.960 --> 35:28.360
Perhaps we could use a five-layer shuttle?

35:28.440 --> 35:31.920
With more blended colors, we could adjust
the number of black and white threads

35:32.000 --> 35:34.760
to create varying shades of gray.

35:34.840 --> 35:36.960
This could work for capturing the shadows
in the clouds and the waves.

35:37.040 --> 35:38.160
Shadows are indeed a good idea,

35:38.240 --> 35:40.480
but if limited to black and white,

35:40.560 --> 35:42.800
the entire piece may seem lifeless.

35:43.320 --> 35:47.000
We could alternate plain and twill weaves

35:47.080 --> 35:50.400
to mimic the flow of nature.

35:50.920 --> 35:52.560
By adjusting the dominant colors,

35:52.640 --> 35:54.200
we can create transitions
and a sense of movement.

35:54.280 --> 35:57.920
Use both plain and twill weaves
for texture

35:58.000 --> 36:00.520
and different colors
to emphasize light and shadow.

36:01.280 --> 36:02.440
If we do it like this,

36:02.960 --> 36:05.560
we might truly capture
the vast essence of the painting.

36:05.640 --> 36:08.600
Alright. I'll pick the threads
and colors right away.

36:08.680 --> 36:10.200
I'll embroider a sample.

36:11.120 --> 36:13.000
Don't you still have
something important to do?

36:13.800 --> 36:16.080
The only thing I need to do now is wait.

36:17.200 --> 36:19.440
Besides, this is important too.

36:23.960 --> 36:24.960
I'll leave first.

36:35.440 --> 36:37.960
I know I was in the wrong, my dear.

36:38.040 --> 36:39.640
I brought shame upon the Hua family.

36:39.720 --> 36:42.920
I wanted to use that punk
to teach the Ji family a lesson.

36:43.000 --> 36:45.520
Who would've thought Ji Yingying would be
the one to benefit instead?

36:49.480 --> 36:50.520
Come here.

36:58.160 --> 36:59.280
Sit down.

37:10.720 --> 37:13.320
I admit I was careless this time, my dear.

37:13.400 --> 37:14.440
That is why I lost.

37:14.520 --> 37:16.000
But next time, I'll make sure
to teach them a real lesson.

37:16.720 --> 37:18.840
How many times have I told you?

37:18.920 --> 37:20.280
Don't get involved personally.

37:20.360 --> 37:21.760
Given your stature,

37:21.840 --> 37:23.280
fight only if victory is certain.

37:23.360 --> 37:24.960
If not, then, flee!

37:25.040 --> 37:26.200
Gently, my dear.

37:28.920 --> 37:32.280
My dear, please don't be upset.
I promise I'll listen to you.

37:40.520 --> 37:43.600
Later, prepare the carriage for me.
I'm going out.

37:51.200 --> 37:53.800
Are you going to see the master?

37:54.400 --> 37:57.880
There is no need for him to act right now.

37:59.480 --> 38:02.520
Simply cause enough trouble

38:03.040 --> 38:06.280
to compel Chief Sang to settle down.

38:18.840 --> 38:20.480
Judging by your expression, Ms. Ji,

38:20.560 --> 38:22.840
you don't seem pleased to see me here.

38:22.920 --> 38:25.000
But alas, a wager is a wager.

38:25.080 --> 38:26.240
Surely, you won't go back on your word,
will you?

38:27.120 --> 38:28.200
Of course I won't.

38:28.720 --> 38:30.080
Mr. Yang, this way.

38:30.160 --> 38:32.520
HESHENG RICE STORE

38:37.160 --> 38:38.280
- Excuse me!
- Where are you running off to?

38:48.800 --> 38:52.080
Even with my limited knowledge, I know
that shortcuts will not lead us there.

38:52.600 --> 38:53.880
You wouldn't understand.

38:53.960 --> 38:55.440
In my family,

38:55.520 --> 38:58.960
the more distinguished the guest,
the more secluded the reception.

39:00.600 --> 39:04.200
Guo Kui, you can't bite him!
Be careful! He is venomous!

39:06.760 --> 39:07.640
Are you Guo Kui?

39:14.440 --> 39:17.320
Well, it seems even dogs fear villains.

39:18.280 --> 39:20.400
- Yingying?
- Yaoting!

39:23.160 --> 39:24.120
Who is this?

39:24.640 --> 39:27.640
My name is Yang.
An honored guest of Ms. Ji.

39:28.360 --> 39:29.200
He is a mere acquaintance.

39:54.960 --> 39:56.800
Is Mother home, Yaoting?

39:57.320 --> 40:00.280
I've been weaving brocade in my room,
so I haven't been to the front yard.

40:00.360 --> 40:02.040
But based on her routine,

40:02.120 --> 40:04.080
Mother is likely out procuring supplies.

40:04.160 --> 40:05.320
That's great!

40:06.320 --> 40:08.560
Yaoting, please fetch
some water for Mr. Yang.

40:08.640 --> 40:10.160
He seems to have a fondness
for the water from our household.

40:10.240 --> 40:11.880
- Okay.
- No rush.

40:11.960 --> 40:14.720
I did not come here
merely to ask for water.

40:14.800 --> 40:16.720
Rather, I came to visit
an old acquaintance.

40:16.800 --> 40:19.080
An old acquaintance? Who might that be?

40:21.360 --> 40:23.360
I recall that your father, Mr. Ji Guinan,

40:23.440 --> 40:25.040
won the weaving competition years ago.

40:25.120 --> 40:28.280
His red Shu brocade
earned resounding applause.

40:28.360 --> 40:30.680
I was captivated by its brilliance.

40:31.520 --> 40:34.920
Even after all these years,
I still cannot forget it.

40:35.520 --> 40:36.760
Yet, who could have imagined that

40:37.520 --> 40:40.040
everything would change,
and nothing remains as it once was?

40:41.160 --> 40:43.600
Are you here just to reminisce, Mr. Yang?

40:45.160 --> 40:48.280
You have spent so many years
with your father, Mr. Ji.

40:48.360 --> 40:49.720
Surely, you must have inherited
some of his skills.

40:52.040 --> 40:53.920
I fear I may disappoint you, Mr. Yang.

40:54.000 --> 40:58.040
When it comes to dyeing silk,
I am rather average compared to Yingying.

40:58.840 --> 41:01.480
Most of the silk in our home
is dyed by her.

41:06.840 --> 41:09.400
Is the dyed silk hanging here to dry?

41:10.000 --> 41:11.880
Some is in the front yard.

41:11.960 --> 41:13.600
Yaoting, why don't you fetch the water?

41:13.680 --> 41:15.320
- Okay.
- No need to hurry.

41:16.440 --> 41:19.520
This is my first time visiting
a brocade family such as yours.

41:20.320 --> 41:22.680
Ms. Ji, why don't you show me around?

41:22.760 --> 41:24.120
I would love to have a closer look.

41:25.640 --> 41:28.080
Our home is modest.
There's not much of interest to see.

41:28.720 --> 41:31.280
A simple home
can possess its own unique charm.

41:41.520 --> 41:42.600
Get some water?

41:48.320 --> 41:51.400
MRS. ZHAO, ZHAO XIUYUAN'S MOTHER

41:52.680 --> 41:56.080
It is an honor to have you
visit our home, Mrs. Zhao.

41:57.000 --> 41:59.240
My daughter and Mr. Zhao
have known each other since childhood.

41:59.320 --> 42:01.600
Have we not already discussed this matter?

42:02.760 --> 42:06.560
It is just that the Zhao family
is particularly strict with the sons.

42:07.080 --> 42:10.160
We do not allow him to marry
unless he has accomplished something.

42:11.080 --> 42:14.680
As a mother, how could I not be anxious
about my son's future?

42:15.640 --> 42:18.520
Yet, I cannot make such decisions
in the family.

42:20.520 --> 42:21.600
I see…

42:22.480 --> 42:24.280
I understand your position, Mrs. Zhao.

42:24.360 --> 42:28.520
I only hope you will speak kindly of us
to your husband.

42:29.040 --> 42:32.480
To be honest, one can marry
before achieving success.

42:32.560 --> 42:34.800
Do you think I have not tried?

42:35.320 --> 42:38.280
But my husband merely picked up his cup
and said to me

42:38.800 --> 42:40.560
the tea costs but three coins a liang,

42:40.640 --> 42:43.000
yet it is served
in a cup worth ten liang of silver.

42:43.520 --> 42:44.840
Do you think they are a good match?
